  "translation": "Harbona, kelen sarisisiw la minnu bɛ masakɛ ɲɛfɛ, a ko: “Hali aw ye, jiri min Haman dilanna Mordekay (Mɔridikay) kama, min y’a kuma ɲuman fɔ masakɛ kan, o jɔlen don Haman so kɔnɔ, a ka gili ɛma tan duru (amma).” Masakɛ ko: “Bɔw ale ye o jiri kan.”",
